# Generated by scripts/vendor-maplibre-worker.js from the INSTALLED maplibre-gl,
# on every Metro run (`expo start`, `expo export`) as well as on demand. It is a
# verbatim copy of a dependency keyed on its version, so committing it would let
# a stale worker outlive a version bump — exactly the failure the version-keyed
# path exists to prevent. Homiio does the same.
public/vendor/

# wrangler's local state: the workerd cache and asset manifest written by
# `wrangler dev`/`wrangler deploy` beside wrangler.toml. Machine-local build
# scratch, never an input to a deploy.
.wrangler/
